Baritone is constructed from a factory for its IPlayerContext instead of from the Minecraft singleton; BaritoneProvider has no primary
instance, no chat control and hands out one instance per createBaritone call. The excluded command manager and elytra process are
replaced by an UnsupportedOperationException and NullElytraProcess, GuiClick by a no-op.

